# The LanceMaster BA4 legacy authoring document is the raw-byte base identity
# for its visual-program overlay. Keep the pinned canonical LF bytes stable
# across core.autocrlf=true worktrees.
/Data/Effects/Authored/effect.lancemaster.skill.34010.ba4.effect.json text eol=lf

# Valtan source-family receipts bind raw JSON bytes across the animation,
# encounter, authored Effect, imported-candidate, and catalog layers. Keep the
# whole joined input/output slice LF-stable so a core.autocrlf=true checkout
